86
00:03:06.850 --> 00:03:08.173
Robin Williams.

87
00:03:09.490 --> 00:03:12.813
Yeah, I know.
(applause)

88
00:03:12.813 --> 00:03:13.646
I know.

89
00:03:14.584 --> 00:03:15.820
I know.

90
00:03:15.820 --> 00:03:19.190 line:15%
So my dad was, is, is a massive fan of comedy

91
00:03:19.190 --> 00:03:21.740 line:15%
