94
00:03:28.530 --> 00:03:31.010
into the world and that your parents, again,

95
00:03:31.010 --> 00:03:33.330
a little crystal ball happening in your family.

96
00:03:33.330 --> 00:03:35.670
Well listen, I am nothing like the great Robin Williams,

97
00:03:35.670 --> 00:03:36.900
and our comedy is very different,

98
00:03:36.900 --> 00:03:41.400
