101
00:03:46.320 --> 00:03:47.390
They'd be like, "Tonight at five" And I'd be like,

102
00:03:47.390 --> 00:03:50.330
"Tonight at five" As a little kid, you know?

103
00:03:50.330 --> 00:03:52.270
And they would be like, they would laugh

104
00:03:52.270 --> 00:03:53.103
