111
00:04:06.933 --> 00:04:08.571
Oh my God!
Which is amazing.

112
00:04:08.571 --> 00:04:10.032
I know.
(applause)

113
00:04:10.032 --> 00:04:12.420
I know, I know, I know.

114
00:04:12.420 --> 00:04:13.870
First black woman in her district.

115
00:04:13.870 --> 00:04:15.820
She's going into her eighth term, she's amazing.

116
00:04:15.820 --> 00:04:17.683
Oh my God, that's so wonderful!

117
00:04:17.683 --> 00:04:18.990
She's incredible.

118
