123
00:04:29.150 --> 00:04:31.100
Okay, it's at Amazon, it's called, "Killing it."

124
00:04:31.100 --> 00:04:33.370
It's a zombie comedy that's Sean of the dead

125
00:04:33.370 --> 00:04:34.300
meets Girls Trip

126
00:04:34.300 --> 00:04:35.133
Like a zomedy.

127
00:04:35.133 --> 00:04:36.770
Yes, like a zomedy.

128
00:04:36.770 --> 00:04:38.190
Like Sean of the dead, like Zombieland,

129
00:04:38.190 --> 00:04:39.340
